# Folding a book outline: collapse one level twice and expand one level, toggle a part's whole subtree, then collapse all inside a zoom leaves the rest of the outline folded as it was at home.
file <<END
Book:
	Part 1
		Chapter 1
			- Outline
			- Draft
		Chapter 2
			- Outline
	Part 2
		Chapter 3
			- Research
Notes:
	- Misc
END
keys -
see       Chapter 1 ▸ 2
keys -
see     Part 1 ▸ 3
see     - Misc
keys =
see       Chapter 3 ▸ 1
keys j "
see ▌   Part 1 ▸ 3
keys "
see         - Draft
keys .
see 󰋜 › Book › Part 1
keys _
see ▌   Chapter 1 ▸ 2
keys gh
see ▌   Part 1
see       Chapter 2 ▸ 1
see       Chapter 3 ▸ 1
see     - Misc
keys j l j j x
see ▌       ✔ Draft
quit
saved <<END
Book:
	Part 1
		Chapter 1
			- Outline
			- Draft @done({today})
		Chapter 2
			- Outline
	Part 2
		Chapter 3
			- Research
Notes:
	- Misc
END
